{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は横浜での握手会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は風邪の治りかけで喉が痛く、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小声＆カンペでしゃべらせていただきました(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あまり会話できなかったり聞きづらかったりで申し訳なかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもみなさん気を遣ってくださったり心配してくださって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うれしかったぁ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパルの応援もすごく心強かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いよいよもうすぐ始まるので、体調万全にして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全力で臨みたいと思います‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の私服☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2013/05/01/%E3%81%84%E3%81%8F%E3%81%9F%EF%BC%92.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カンペの中の一枚。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/blog/erika.ikuta/img/2013/05/01/%E3%81%84%E3%81%8F%E3%81%9F%EF%BC%93.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"withまいやん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美雲ちゃんの卒業が発表され、ファンの方々に向けて挨拶がありました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん寂しいという気持ちもいっぱいですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"美雲ちゃんは自分の志を持って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しっかりと道を歩んでいくんだと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してるから、やりたいこと精一杯頑張ってね。"},{